    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d489">

                <pb facs="0907" n="803" xml:id="pg803"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">Hopkins Papers</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The President’s Special Assistant</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Hopkins</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the British
                        Secretary of State for Foreign Affairs</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Eden</hi>), <hi rendition="#italic">and Reply</hi><anchor n="1"
                        xml:id="d489-f1"/></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">[<placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Cairo</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1943-12-05">December 5 (?), 1943</date>.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Anthony</hi>:—It looks like <hi
                        rendition="#small-caps">Buccaneer</hi> is out &amp; our military plans hence
                    will be agreed to tomorrow</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Harry</hi></signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>If so, you have been very generous, but our chances next year will surely
                        benefit.</p>
                    <p>President has been grand about it all.</p>
                    <p>Note reinforcements (Scotch) just came in!</p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d489-f1" n="1" type="source" xml:id="d489-f1-content">
                <p>The exchange, which was handwritten on a single sheet of paper, presumably took
                    place during the quadripartite dinner meeting, <hi rendition="#italic"
                    >ante</hi>, <ref target="#pg733">p. 733</ref>.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
